  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1443059515392
    m_Localized: Savings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267617513472
    m_Localized: Start with an additional {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902080
    m_Localized: Bad Lease
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902081
    m_Localized: Your starting rent is increased by {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902086
    m_Localized: Convict
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902087
    m_Localized: Start with an additional {0} Security Reputation and will receive {1}% less reward for reporting customers on the Wanted List.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902088
    m_Localized: Model Citizen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902089
    m_Localized: Start with an additional +{0} Security Reputation and will receive {1}% more reward for reporting customers on the Wanted List.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902090
    m_Localized: Well Connected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902091
    m_Localized: Start with an additional {0} Reputation with all factions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902092
    m_Localized: Vigilant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902093
    m_Localized: You will never get robbed during the night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902094
    m_Localized: Sawyer's Crew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902095
    m_Localized: The Underground Exchange is available from the start. Janitorial Service is always free,  unless the Store is vandalized. Vandalism clean up cost is significantly reduced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902096
    m_Localized: Diplomatic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902097
    m_Localized: Reputation generated from trade is increased by {0}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902098
    m_Localized: Intimidating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902099
    m_Localized: All committed crimes generate {0}% less available evidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902100
    m_Localized: Side Street
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902101
    m_Localized: You get one less random customer per day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902102
    m_Localized: Nicotine Addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902103
    m_Localized: You will suffer a trade penalty of {0}% if you don't consume nicotine regularly. The addiction can be cured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902104
    m_Localized: Narcotic Addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902105
    m_Localized: You will suffer a trade penalty of {0}% if you don't consume narcotics regularly. The addiction can be cured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902106
    m_Localized: Alcohol Addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902107
    m_Localized: You will suffer a trade penalty of {0}% if you don't consume alcohol regularly. The addiction can be cured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902108
    m_Localized: Secret Admirer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902109
    m_Localized: You will occasionally receive random items from a secret admirer when opening the Store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902110
    m_Localized: Colorful Character
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902111
    m_Localized: Allows you to have {0} additional starting perk slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902112
    m_Localized: Blackmail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902113
    m_Localized: You have a questionable past and a blackmailer is threatening to expose your secret. You will have to pay them a small weekly fee or they will expose you,  leading to a major one-time loss to your reputation across most factions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902114
    m_Localized: Blabbermouth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902115
    m_Localized: All committed crimes generate {0}% more available evidence. You will gain 50% less reputation with the Black Market and the Revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902116
    m_Localized: Unsubscribed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902117
    m_Localized: You will not receive the daily newspaper that informs you about ongoing events.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902118
    m_Localized: Minimalist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902119
    m_Localized: Your main inventory is reduced 20x10 instead of 24x10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902120
    m_Localized: Sentinel Collapse Disorder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902121
    m_Localized: You suffer from a deadly, incurable auto-immune condition and must take a weekly Immunivax injection to stay alive. Start the game with 1 Immunivax Injector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902124
    m_Localized: Speedy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902125
    m_Localized: You can visit up to 2 after-hours locations every night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902126
    m_Localized: Agoraphobia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902128
    m_Localized: Welfare Program
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902129
    m_Localized: The Commissary is available from the start.  On Mondays, you may receive Food Stamps depending on your total wealth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902130
    m_Localized: Proficient Scavenger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902131
    m_Localized: You can perform up to 2 additional Search actions in the Dumping Grounds every time you visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902132
    m_Localized: Revolution Sympathizer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902133
    m_Localized: Start with an additional {0} Reputation with The Revolution. You will receive Marketplace Requests from The Revolution more frequently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902134
    m_Localized: Gambling Addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902135
    m_Localized: You will always buy some Lottery Tickets when possible. All lottery content is unlocked from the start. The addiction can be cured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902136
    m_Localized: Tapehead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902137
    m_Localized: You start with all music cassettes available inside the cassette player.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902138
    m_Localized: Expedition Organizer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902139
    m_Localized: You can hire certain characters and organize expeditions. Unlock Expedition content from the start along with a Hireling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902140
    m_Localized: Vending Machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9267625902141
    m_Localized: Start with a vending machine installed in front of your store. Allow customers to purchase items automatically during after-hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12200241315840
    m_Localized: Perk Point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313910013952
    m_Localized: Short Sleeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313926791168
    m_Localized: You won't miss out on any customers when going out during after-hours activities the night before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313926791169
    m_Localized: Working Pipes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313926791170
    m_Localized: You will start with the water lines already connected with unlimited Rustwater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313926791171
    m_Localized: Illiterate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313926791172
    m_Localized: You won't be able to read any guide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313926791173
    m_Localized: Prime Real Estate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18833313930985472
    m_Localized: '1 more normal customer will visit everyday but starting rent cost {0} credit more. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74930876391931904
    m_Localized: Degenerative Osteoarthritis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74930876442263552
    m_Localized: Scavenging in the dumping ground works normally for the first week. After that, you lose 1 max scavenging attempt every week that passes. Once your max attempts fall below {0}, you can no longer scavenge at all. Normal shopkeepers start with {1} daily max attempts. Start with {2} additional topical medication bandages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74930876442263553
    m_Localized: Known Snitch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74930876442263554
    m_Localized: Customers from the wanted poster will never visit your store. Start with {0} reputation with the Revolution and the Black Market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180758536192
    m_Localized: Handy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673536
    m_Localized: 'Start with a shabby toolbox and a set of shabby tools: a screwdriver, a wire cutter, a crowbar and a plasma cutter.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673537
    m_Localized: Public Enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673538
    m_Localized: Start with {0} Reputation with all factions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673539
    m_Localized: Ascetic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673540
    m_Localized: Your main inventory is reduced to {0}x10 instead of 24x10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673541
    m_Localized: Maimed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673542
    m_Localized: The Dumping Ground is not available. You cannot scavenge at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673543
    m_Localized: Wild's Favorite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673544
    m_Localized: All upgrades from Wild's Network cost {0}% less. Insurance costs {1}% less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673545
    m_Localized: On Wild's Bad Side
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673546
    m_Localized: All upgrades from Wild's Network cost {0}% more. Insurance costs {1}% more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673547
    m_Localized: Aug Menace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673548
    m_Localized: The Augmented content is unlocked at the start of the game. Earn {0}% more credits for killing an aug. The aug menace never ends, and letting too many augs get away ends the game on every difficulty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673549
    m_Localized: Lucky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673550
    m_Localized: Increases your luck. Probably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673551
    m_Localized: Unlucky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88102180804673552
    m_Localized: Decreases your luck. Probably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520854233088
    m_Localized: You are unable leave the Store to visit any after-hours locations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593216
    m_Localized: Tinkerer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593217
    m_Localized: When you upgrade an item, there is a {0}% chance the material used is not consumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593218
    m_Localized: Careful Scavenger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593219
    m_Localized: You can perform {0} fewer actions in the Dumping Grounds every time you visit, but you never get injured while searching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593220
    m_Localized: Sycophant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593221
    m_Localized: Start with an additional +{0} Upper Levels Reputation. Reputation gained with the Upper Levels is increased by {1}%, and Upper Level customers have {2}% more budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593222
    m_Localized: After visiting an after-hours location, you must rest at the Store for {0} nights before going out again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593223
    m_Localized: Awful Negotiator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593224
    m_Localized: You cannot bargain with customers, and you suffer a permanent trade penalty of {0}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593225
    m_Localized: Banned from the Commissary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593226
    m_Localized: The Commissary is not available, and food stamps are never introduced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593227
    m_Localized: Hoarder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593228
    m_Localized: Start with three piles of immovable debris along the bottom of your inventory. Each pile can be removed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593229
    m_Localized: Makeshift Reactor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89630520883593230
    m_Localized: You are permanently disconnected from the station power grid and are not affected by blackouts. Start with an upgradable Makeshift Micro Nuclear Reactor sold to you by Dr. Jackson. It powers the Store but needs regular repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
